WEBVTT

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:29.919
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:00:29.943 --> 00:00:33.777
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:01:47.353 --> 00:01:50.789
Go on! Cut me down, Orson!

00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:03.666
Orson... Orson...

00:02:09.876 --> 00:02:12.345
ORSON!!

00:02:16.482 --> 00:02:21.921
You idiot! You were finally cured,
and then for my sake...!

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:28.460
For my sake... You fell in
love with me and died...

00:02:29.429 --> 00:02:33.195
But if you die now,
it'll have been for nothing...

00:02:35.969 --> 00:02:39.200
Nothing at all...

00:02:39.272 --> 00:02:39.932
Deed!

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:02.258
This is...

00:03:08.334 --> 00:03:10.029
Sir Ashram!

00:03:10.937 --> 00:03:13.235
No doubt about it!

00:03:13.306 --> 00:03:15.968
That's the Governor's Treasure
we've been searching for!

00:03:17.343 --> 00:03:19.277
The Scepter of Domination!

00:03:20.346 --> 00:03:24.544
With that... With that,
| will make Lodoss mine!

00:03:25.652 --> 00:03:29.611
Create the dream of a united Lodoss
Emperor Beld wasn't able to make!

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:33.118
The day I've waited for is at hand!

00:03:33.192 --> 00:03:34.591
Sir Ashram!

00:03:36.829 --> 00:03:38.160
What?!

00:03:50.309 --> 00:03:53.279
Impossible! Shooting Star?!

00:03:53.346 --> 00:03:55.940
| thought he had flown out to feed!

00:03:57.283 --> 00:03:58.944
Sir Ashram, we can't!

00:03:59.018 --> 00:04:02.010
Let's wait for Groder
and the others to join us!

00:04:02.422 --> 00:04:03.856
But...!

00:04:14.701 --> 00:04:18.001
The magical
restriction put on him by...

00:04:18.071 --> 00:04:21.803
...the governor of the
ancient kingdom of Kastuul.

00:04:21.874 --> 00:04:24.707
80 long as there are men who
desire the Scepter of Domination...

00:04:24.777 --> 00:04:27.769
...he can never
fly away to anywhere else.

00:04:28.614 --> 00:04:30.378
King Kashue!

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:33.010
It's been a while, Hobb.

00:04:33.086 --> 00:04:37.216
And you, Ashram.
| definitely remember you.

00:04:39.992 --> 00:04:45.021
Sadly, |, too, haven't forgotten
your face over these last few years.

00:04:45.565 --> 00:04:47.397
Shall we end things here?

00:04:47.467 --> 00:04:50.493
We'll eventually have to
kill the fire dragon, so...

00:04:51.971 --> 00:04:54.440
...won't you help me?

00:04:54.507 --> 00:04:56.339
Are you insulting me?!

00:04:56.409 --> 00:04:57.638
Calm down.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:00.702
I have no illusions about
you and I becoming allies.

00:05:01.147 --> 00:05:05.675
But I happen to hate Shooting
Star more than I hate you.

00:05:07.086 --> 00:05:12.149
You've taken me lightly.
However, it's you that I hate.

00:05:13.159 --> 00:05:15.753
Why don't we work together first?

00:05:15.828 --> 00:05:20.493
There'll be time enough for our duel
after the fire dragon is dead.

00:05:21.033 --> 00:05:23.468
What did you say?

00:05:23.536 --> 00:05:25.937
I've heard that
the Scepter of Domination...

00:05:26.005 --> 00:05:28.736
...has the power to make
even your enemies obey you.

00:05:28.808 --> 00:05:32.711
You and |, as well as whatever
allies we've brought with us.

00:05:32.779 --> 00:05:35.339
We will fight and
the true victor will be...

00:05:35.414 --> 00:05:38.111
...the one to get
the Scepter of Domination.

00:05:38.184 --> 00:05:44.556
Interesting. But I've already seen
how you fight in single combat.

00:05:44.791 --> 00:05:48.125
The advantage you took
when fighting Emperor Beld.

00:05:48.194 --> 00:05:53.530
| of fer no excuses. But there
was no other way at the time.

00:05:54.333 --> 00:05:58.531
And you dare call yourself
a hero who saved Lodoss?!

00:05:58.604 --> 00:06:01.596
You, who broke the
rules of single combat?!

00:06:01.774 --> 00:06:04.539
Sir Ashram, what are you...?!

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:09.275
It was five years ago, during single
combat in the War of Heroes!

00:06:10.817 --> 00:06:15.448
An arrow fired by someone
struck Emperor Beld in the arm!

00:06:24.897 --> 00:06:29.130
He took advantage of that
moment to win the fight!

00:06:30.469 --> 00:06:33.962
If I'd thought of stopping,
I might have stopped my sword.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:39.444
But instead, I swung it!
| wanted to finish Beld off...

00:06:39.512 --> 00:06:42.413
Wh- What are you saying...?!

00:06:42.481 --> 00:06:45.007
Will the god of war
condemn me for that?

00:06:45.084 --> 00:06:49.920
Will he curse my name as a knight
for having saved all of Lodoss?!

00:06:49.989 --> 00:06:53.425
W- Well... But...!

00:06:53.492 --> 00:06:54.721
King Kashue!

00:06:54.794 --> 00:06:56.523
Parn!

00:06:58.297 --> 00:07:01.028
You don't have to make
any deals with these guys!

00:07:01.133 --> 00:07:03.431
We've already beaten Ashram's party!

00:07:04.403 --> 00:07:08.135
Groder and the others were beaten?!
Im- Impossible!

00:07:08.741 --> 00:07:10.607
Let's finish these two off!

00:07:10.676 --> 00:07:13.668
Then we can beat
Shooting Star ourselves!

00:07:13.746 --> 00:07:14.406
Parn!

00:07:15.181 --> 00:07:18.151
I must repay
the debt I owe to him!

00:07:18.484 --> 00:07:21.283
As a knight...and as a king!

00:07:23.322 --> 00:07:27.555
We WILL slay Shooting Star!

00:07:29.228 --> 00:07:31.060
Did you hear the agreement, Hobb?!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.996
I have heard!

00:07:34.166 --> 00:07:36.794
"Let he who breaks this promise
feel the wrath of Myrii!"

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:38.203
Parn!

00:07:38.271 --> 00:07:40.296
Deed! Summon a water spirit!

00:07:40.373 --> 00:07:43.365
Protect King Kashue from
the fire dragon's flames!

00:07:45.144 --> 00:07:47.078
Leylia!
Cast a protection spell, too!

00:07:47.146 --> 00:07:48.079
Right!

00:07:48.147 --> 00:07:50.639
Cecil, you cover King Kashue!

00:07:50.716 --> 00:07:52.275
You don't have to tell me twice!

00:07:52.351 --> 00:07:55.048
"Feet of the salamander,
breath of the ifreet..”

00:07:55.121 --> 00:07:57.146
"Angry heart of the titans
of creation..”

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:02.087
"Marfa, mother of the earth! Protect
him from the demonic fire!"

00:08:02.595 --> 00:08:05.530
"Spirit of water! Blessed maiden!"

00:08:05.598 --> 00:08:08.397
"Form a shield of water around
the warriors gathered here!"

00:08:13.472 --> 00:08:16.931
For all the brave men of
Flaim that you killed...

00:08:17.009 --> 00:08:19.171
Feel their anger unleashed!

00:08:19.245 --> 00:08:20.872
Damned human...

00:08:23.549 --> 00:08:26.644
Vanna flame ve igloss!

00:08:32.758 --> 00:08:33.691
Highness!

00:08:46.772 --> 00:08:47.637
Sir Ashram!

00:08:55.014 --> 00:08:56.175
His blind eye...!

00:08:56.248 --> 00:09:00.651
I'll distract him.
Get around to his blind side.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:01.846
But, Highness...!

00:09:01.921 --> 00:09:04.447
There's no time to hesitate!
Let's go!

00:09:04.824 --> 00:09:06.121
Highness!

00:09:12.331 --> 00:09:16.131
"Great god Myrii,
who rules over war."

00:09:16.836 --> 00:09:19.464
"Give comfort
to this warrior's wounds."

00:09:30.116 --> 00:09:32.881
Sir Ashram! Sir Ashram, wait!

00:09:41.627 --> 00:09:45.222
Oh... Oh, wow! I'm right
in the middle of the action!

00:09:45.297 --> 00:09:47.061
I'll be able to write a REALLY
great ballad about this!

00:09:51.637 --> 00:09:55.073
It's no use! The sylph are too
weak inside this volcano!

00:09:55.141 --> 00:09:56.438
At this rate...!

00:09:57.643 --> 00:10:01.045
"Roar of the demon wolf,
embrace of white snow!"

00:10:01.113 --> 00:10:02.740
"Manna of all creation!”

00:10:09.655 --> 00:10:12.283
"Become a blade of ice
to cut the fire apart!"

00:10:18.731 --> 00:10:19.425
Parn!

00:10:30.976 --> 00:10:35.573
"Great spirit of the earth!
Mighty beast of the ground below!"

00:10:35.648 --> 00:10:37.639
"I beg you! Answer my call!”

00:10:53.899 --> 00:10:59.030
Curse...you..humans...!

00:11:07.179 --> 00:11:09.273
All right!
That was incredible!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.965
We did it...
We beat Shooting Star!

00:11:35.374 --> 00:11:36.398
Sir Ashram!

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:55.986
Parn!

00:11:56.061 --> 00:11:59.053
King Kashue... Ashram...

00:12:02.001 --> 00:12:05.631
Sir Ashram! Wait, please!
Let me cast a healing spell!

00:12:06.272 --> 00:12:08.036
Signal the start of the duel...!

00:12:09.008 --> 00:12:10.339
But, sir...!

00:12:12.611 --> 00:12:13.908
Hobb...

00:12:13.979 --> 00:12:16.175
"In the name of Myrii,
god of war.."

00:12:16.248 --> 00:12:18.580
"..let the agreement of these
knights be carried out!"

00:12:33.065 --> 00:12:34.157
King Kashue!

00:12:34.233 --> 00:12:34.961
Deed!

00:12:35.034 --> 00:12:36.001
Parn...

00:12:36.068 --> 00:12:37.866
It's all right.
His Highness will win!

00:12:37.937 --> 00:12:39.496
But...

00:12:39.572 --> 00:12:42.735
Only interfere if it looks
like he's going to die!

00:12:53.152 --> 00:12:56.315
Why does this battle
have to go on?

00:12:57.223 --> 00:12:59.954
You're both great heroes!

00:13:00.025 --> 00:13:04.326
You both have ideals and both
give all you have to realize them!

00:13:04.997 --> 00:13:06.988
So why must you do this?!

00:13:07.866 --> 00:13:10.858
You say I force you to do this, but
you do this for your own ideals!

00:13:12.238 --> 00:13:14.536
We're not the same!

00:13:14.607 --> 00:13:17.042
| am not as driven by
my ideals as you are!

00:13:17.109 --> 00:13:19.407
But I am the king of Flaim!

00:13:19.812 --> 00:13:22.975
To protect my kingdom,
I must risk my life itself!

00:13:23.782 --> 00:13:27.582
That is why I turned my back
when I saw Raiden burning!

00:13:27.653 --> 00:13:32.318
As a king, it was my responsibility
and my duty to see this through!

00:13:33.692 --> 00:13:37.026
You're just a foolish man who's
trapped by his position as king!

00:13:38.664 --> 00:13:42.294
Well, then, I'll finish you of f
like we did Shooting Star!

00:13:44.603 --> 00:13:45.468
Highness!

00:13:45.537 --> 00:13:46.402
DIEM!

00:13:59.485 --> 00:14:01.044
Wh- Why?!

00:14:07.493 --> 00:14:08.688
Sir Ashram!

00:14:13.799 --> 00:14:15.597
How could I have lost?

00:14:16.568 --> 00:14:22.302
It can't be...
It can't-- It can't be...

00:14:23.542 --> 00:14:25.533
Let this end.

00:14:25.944 --> 00:14:28.606
Please, won't you let this end?

00:14:28.681 --> 00:14:30.649
Why...?

00:14:30.716 --> 00:14:33.208
Why can't I beat this man?

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:40.589
I... I have to fulfill
Emperor Beld's wishes!

00:14:51.437 --> 00:14:54.873
Yes... No matter what...

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:58.643
What?!

00:14:58.711 --> 00:14:59.542
Parn!

00:15:06.085 --> 00:15:08.713
Ashram! Have you forgotten
your own agreement?!

00:15:10.789 --> 00:15:13.053
| won't lose to
the likes of you!

00:15:18.897 --> 00:15:21.423
With this...

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.400
With this, I can finally...

00:15:33.078 --> 00:15:35.410
| can unite Lodoss!

00:15:36.648 --> 00:15:39.618
If you'd charged in
after parrying my attack...

00:15:39.685 --> 00:15:41.653
...without thinking
about the consequences...

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:44.155
...you may well have won.

00:16:06.879 --> 00:16:08.472
Ashram...

00:16:13.285 --> 00:16:18.621
A united Lodoss...
Emperor Beld's dream...

00:16:22.728 --> 00:16:23.854
Ashram!

00:16:25.364 --> 00:16:26.832
Highness!

00:16:28.667 --> 00:16:32.433
It's not that he forgot the
agreement he made before.

00:16:32.504 --> 00:16:34.029
Let him do as he pleases.

00:16:36.842 --> 00:16:39.573
Emperor Beld's...wish...

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:50.016
My..dreams...

00:16:54.259 --> 00:16:59.356
No... Why did Sir Ashram
break his agreement?!

00:17:00.566 --> 00:17:03.763
A warrior... A hero like him!

00:17:04.203 --> 00:17:06.934
Have I been blind all this time?!

00:17:07.139 --> 00:17:09.437
A hero is still only a man.

00:17:10.209 --> 00:17:13.110
And when a man pursues
his own desires...

00:17:13.178 --> 00:17:16.273
...he will sometimes
act without thinking.

00:17:16.748 --> 00:17:21.276
I, too, am a coward who
broke his word to someone.

00:17:22.955 --> 00:17:24.184
King Kashue...

00:17:25.691 --> 00:17:29.924
I set out on this journey
to confirm my own faith.

00:17:30.462 --> 00:17:34.023
To see what true valor... To see
what a true hero really is.

00:17:34.333 --> 00:17:37.860
And to find the true meaning of war.

00:17:39.004 --> 00:17:42.872
When you've found that meaning,
then return and visit us in Blade.

00:17:42.941 --> 00:17:46.343
I still need your power.

00:17:47.045 --> 00:17:48.604
Y- Yes, sir...

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:52.412
However...
I've been thinking...

00:17:52.484 --> 00:17:53.349
Parn!

00:17:53.418 --> 00:17:55.284
You were great!

00:17:55.354 --> 00:17:56.879
Good work, Parn.

00:17:57.389 --> 00:17:58.447
Deed!

00:17:59.558 --> 00:18:02.994
That young warrior may
be the true hero you seek.

00:18:11.403 --> 00:18:12.734
So, you won.

00:18:12.804 --> 00:18:14.431
Yeah...

00:18:14.506 --> 00:18:16.099
| won the battle...

00:18:16.174 --> 00:18:21.738
...but who was the real winner
and who was the real loser?

00:18:22.948 --> 00:18:26.111
| wasn't able to save Orson. Or...

00:18:27.586 --> 00:18:30.055
This girl's heart, either-...

00:18:30.122 --> 00:18:32.648
Well, shall we get going?

00:18:33.992 --> 00:18:36.051
It's time to stop feeling sad!

00:18:36.128 --> 00:18:40.122
I've decided I'm going to keep
on living my life the way I want to.

00:18:41.433 --> 00:18:42.559
Shirts...

00:18:42.634 --> 00:18:46.537
After all, that's why Orson left
me a life to have, right?

00:18:47.039 --> 00:18:50.339
Y- Yeah... Yeah, you're right.

00:18:51.143 --> 00:18:53.134
Well, then, shall we go?

00:18:56.715 --> 00:18:59.275
It's better this way, Orson...

00:19:08.427 --> 00:19:10.054
Let's go, Parn.

00:19:10.929 --> 00:19:13.830
Let's go home to our village.

00:19:13.899 --> 00:19:16.391
To the Lodoss we all saved!

00:19:17.569 --> 00:19:19.765
To the south of the continent
of Alecrast

00:19:19.838 --> 00:19:21.829
lies an island called Lodoss.

00:19:23.175 --> 00:19:25.769
Onto its war-filled history,

00:19:25.844 --> 00:19:30.042
the chronicle of a new hero
has been engraved.

00:19:30.115 --> 00:19:32.140
And onto the heart of the hero...

00:19:32.217 --> 00:19:37.018
...the joy of being a true victor
was engraved for evermore.

00:19:43.228 --> 00:19:44.423
Welcome...

00:19:44.496 --> 00:19:45.964
...to Lodoss Island!

00:19:46.031 --> 00:19:47.465
And now, what you've
all been waiting for...

00:19:47.532 --> 00:19:49.261
...the second part of the show!

00:19:57.776 --> 00:19:59.608
Hi there!
Are you enjoying yourselves?

00:19:59.678 --> 00:20:01.737
Welcome to Lodoss Island!

00:20:01.813 --> 00:20:04.305
This is DJ Parn and Deed here...

00:20:04.383 --> 00:20:07.318
...and now it's time for the "How,
What, and Why Question Corner!"

00:20:07.853 --> 00:20:09.981
Okay, let's start
with our first question!

00:20:10.055 --> 00:20:13.855
How did King Kashue beat Ashram?

00:20:14.192 --> 00:20:16.889
That's our first question,
and for the answer...

00:20:16.962 --> 00:20:19.624
...we turn to our reporter
on the scene, Shirts!

00:20:19.698 --> 00:20:22.224
Shirts? Shirts! Take it away!

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:25.270
This is Shirts, coming to
you from castle Akroyd!

00:20:25.337 --> 00:20:28.432
First of all, how did such a
laid back guy like King Kashue...

00:20:31.977 --> 00:20:35.504
...um, beat a
dedicated man like Ashram?

00:20:36.014 --> 00:20:38.506
I think we may be close to
uncovering this mystery!

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:40.809
That's not exactly
a difficult thing to do!

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:44.284
There was no way
that little pipsqueak...

00:20:44.356 --> 00:20:47.189
...could beat ME,
the mercenary king of Flaim!

00:20:47.259 --> 00:20:49.284
But we understand that Ashram...

00:20:49.361 --> 00:20:52.422
...has a very powerful
demon sword called Soul Crusher.

00:20:52.497 --> 00:20:54.329
What about that?

00:20:54.399 --> 00:20:56.128
The demon sword
Soul Crusher, huh?

00:20:56.201 --> 00:20:58.135
Uh-oh, here it comes...

00:20:58.203 --> 00:21:02.162
King Kashue, can I take that devil
may care smile to mean that...

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.732
Soul Crusher was no trouble at all!

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:07.279
| won't lose (MAKEN) to
any demon sword (MA KEN)!

00:21:09.948 --> 00:21:11.916
And question number two...

00:21:11.983 --> 00:21:14.782
What was the War of Heroes?

00:21:14.853 --> 00:21:17.948
That's a very good question.
Now, then...

00:21:18.023 --> 00:21:20.321
...why don't we touch
on the War of Heroes...

00:21:20.392 --> 00:21:23.521
...which was caused five years
ago by Emperor Beld of Marmo?

00:21:26.398 --> 00:21:28.196
There! We touched it!

00:21:29.634 --> 00:21:31.932
Well, that's all for today!

00:21:32.003 --> 00:21:35.871
So long! So long! So long!

00:21:36.475 --> 00:21:37.499
Bye!

00:22:59.791 --> 00:23:02.055
Ten years have passed since the
showdown at Fire Dragon Mountain.

00:23:02.127 --> 00:23:06.064
As time slipped by, the heroes
each left on their own paths.

00:23:06.431 --> 00:23:09.298
And as the history of
Lodoss has done in the past...

00:23:09.367 --> 00:23:12.769
...a young man is given
a new mission to follow.

00:23:14.005 --> 00:23:17.964
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:18.143 --> 00:23:20.578
"The Young Knight...
Tested Strength.”
